			"date": "2023-02-05T02:57:13.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Yeah, we're in the beginning of a difficult time where we see the end of React in the distance and we all need to guess how fast it's coming and what the need of the project is. </p><p>My gut right now: if I had to build an app from scratch that needed that level of complexity, I'd probably use svelte or solidjs at this point because those seem like they have a longer future.</p>",
