			},
			"date": "2023-02-05T21:35:58.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> An elephant in the room is <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/wordpress\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>wordpress</span></a> adopting React for Gutenberg. React is the future of block development for WordPress, and with ~43% of all websites running React/WordPress, the near future will only increasingly be React.</p>",
